# Listening and thinking: Xardas' face close up. Quiet; the hero speaks to him 6 s (his words come every
# 0.6 s, as the bridge passes the partial transcripts of the hero's voice: Xardas listens, nods now and
# then); he thinks of an answer 2.5 s (the eyes go aside and up, the head tilts); he answers with a line
# of the game (the eyes come back). With `gestures off` on top of a copy: he stands still, as before.
cheat god
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 150 0
cam face 45 15 1
wait 800
rec quiet
wait 2500
stop
hear nearest 6000
rec listen
wait 6000
stop
think nearest 2500
rec think
wait 2500
stop
speak nearest DIA_Addon_Xardas_Hello_14_00
rec answer
wait 4000
stop
